"persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198271699251/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 5655, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 601, "last_played": 1773476825, "avatar": "1175da739c0fa001743691c0e735b8625d7d53dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "BS.  no controller support.\nlook for a mod to fix it.", "timestamp_created": 1611306146, "timestamp_updated": 1611306146, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.444444447755813599", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85105818", "author": {"steamid": "76561198835531946", "personaname": "cyrhil17", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cyrhil/", "num_games_owned": 95, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 2678, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2678, "last_played": 1611259372, "avatar": "3d2fd909cc3de7f1ab64094c6d47f8ece587ebc9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Абсолютно топове завершення топової трилогії! 10/10 насправді легендарна гра!", "timestamp_created": 1611259479, "timestamp_updated": 1611259479, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503614425659179688", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85105342", "author": {"steamid": "76561198364456723", "personaname": "korri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kkorri/", "num_games_owned": 329, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 3501, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3475, "last_played": 1616829103, "avatar": "2d54358b33193da4ef288d455339c94f77f9dd87"}, "language": "english", "review": "The endings aren't even bad, I don't get the hate. Controversial opinion, but this was my favorite game of the trilogy. This game forces you to make a lot of hard choices, sacrificing worlds and lives all in pursuit of a larger goal. I found myself staring at my screen for minutes at a time debating the options presented towards me. Shepard has some of his best moments in the series in this game. My favorite mission of the series is in this game. The music is top notch. Some visuals are good, while some are starting to show their age. Nothing too bad, though.\nLargest complaint I have is the bugs, though these are almost always visual (Shepard not going down ladders correctly, characters not appearing in cutscenes even though their voices are heard). One major bug that I encountered is on the Normandy. If you go over to Joker to speak to him, it is very easy to get stuck on the terrain there, forcing you to reload a save. Tread carefully.\nThis might be my favorite video game trilogy in existence. Do yourself a favor and play these three masterpieces.", "timestamp_created": 1611258803, "timestamp_updated": 1611391091, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85074102", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063702126", "personaname": "Existed™", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Existed/", "num_games_owned": 1115, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 7196, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5106, "last_played": 1612630104, "avatar": "0464dd2adff73287fe97c426dce2380eb1aa5b47"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm just playing this while I wait for the Legendary Edition to come out.", "timestamp_created": 1611213888, "timestamp_updated": 1611213888, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85069313", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040782147", "personaname": "Neinomangos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/neinomangos/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 6130, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2327, "last_played": 1616262259, "avatar": "277fad8dc0c2dd3bd03b1eb502ef2beefa973b16"}, "language": "english", "review": "haven't even finished the game yet and i already know this is my favourite entry of the series. the combat is so fluid, the characters, the story?? everything is amazing. don't even get me started on the citadel dlc. love this series so much.", "timestamp_created": 1611204290, "timestamp_updated": 1611204290, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85013228", "author": {"steamid": "76561198821866649", "personaname": "Neraxsus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198821866649/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 5019, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2639, "last_played": 1650346091, "avatar": "c0dc89f8b3041aacb9e7106e581f0b503b576cf5"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's extremely fun, interesting, and makes you choose tough choices, after playing all three games, this 100% has